<title>UK: Exim Bank of Japan sets 2.0 bln Ffr 11-year bond.</title>
<headline>Exim Bank of Japan sets 2.0 bln Ffr 11-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers  IBJ and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT-IMPORT BANK OF JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    05.JUN.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.721    PAY DATE    05.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    99.721    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LON/PARIS PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
